# USART3 RX: DMA1_Stream1 channel 4; USART2 RX: DMA1_Stream5 channel 4.
# Both circular, byte/byte, memory increment, direct mode, high priority.
# UART/DMA HT/TC/IDLE IRQs all preempt priorities = 5; DMA buffer in SRAM1/2.
# HSE 8 MHz; PLL M=8 N=336 P=2 Q=7; AHB/1 APB1/4 APB2/2.
# Hold PHY reset PD3 LOW and MDC PC1 LOW BEFORE UART2 PA2/PA3 AF7.
# Do not initialize ETH/audio/I2S. This does not prove PHY MDIO is high impedance.
# Remove P2/P4 peripheral jumpers and audio jumpers; see docs/proposed_wiring.md.
# Start at 115200; qualify 460800 electrically and update all communicating peers.
